user.description:
A system is everything that delivers power to the house through one output: an inverter, a device with PV and battery, a battery at the house grid, or several devices that coordinate. Choose what fits; the template fills in the settings, each stays changeable. Then add its PV arrays, its battery or its subsystems in the system's menu.

{concept}

{diagram}

basics.description:
What the system is and where it belongs. A system with "Belongs to" is a subsystem of another: a device that its control coordinates. Its shared limit and its regulation hold here as well.

{concept}

{diagram}

array.description:
Modules whose power is measured together (e.g. one MPPT input). Several power sensors are summed. Modules facing different directions: enter the first orientation here and the others under further orientations.

{concept}

{diagram}
